  "releaseNotes": "[8.1.0] - 2026-01-11\n      - TransactionContext now isolated per DatabaseFacade\n      - UnitOfWork is now disposable\n      - UnitOfWork now creates its own DbContext instance by using the provided factory\n      - UnitOfWork no longer implements Attach/Detach methods\n      - Repositories now implement Attach/Detach methods\n      - GenericRepository renamed to DefaultRepository\n      - Sql queries now contain SqlFirstOrDefaultAsync/RawSqlFirstOrDefaultAsync methods\n      - Sql queries now return IReadOnlyList instead of array to improve performance (less reallocations)",
